<title>LUXEMBOURG: EU cuts 1997/98 sugar storage refund.</title>
<headline>EU cuts 1997/98 sugar storage refund.</headline>
<dateline>LUXEMBOURG 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union farm ministers agreed on Wednesday to cut the monthly sugar storage refund to 0.38 Ecus per 100 kg in 1997/98 (July/June) from 0.42 Ecus per 100 kg in 1996/97, EU officials said.</p>
<p>The decision, part of an annual farm price package, overturned a European Commission proposal for a 17 percent cut to 0.35 Ecus per 100 kg to take account of lower storage costs following a fall in interest rates.</p>
<p>--Luxembourg bureau +352 57262</p>
</text>
